	<name>jee-liberty-posts</name>
	<comment>A Java EE backend application running on IBM Liberty, providing RESTful APIs with JAX-RS, business logic with EJB, and persistence with OpenJPA. The application is designed to replace the existing Spring Boot implementation while maintaining Swagger-defined endpoints. NO_M2ECLIPSE_SUPPORT: Project files created with the maven-eclipse-plugin are not supported in M2Eclipse.</comment>
